OL,3,GNEWSABalloon flight captures Goose Fair
OL,4,Afrom the air
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe colourful sights of Nottingham's
OL,7,FGoose Fair have been captured from the
OL,8,Fair by a unique hot air balloon club.
OL,10,FMembers of Nottingham and Derby Hot Air
OL,11,FBalloon Club launched from Nottingham
OL,12,FHigh School on Monday before flying
OL,13,Fover the annual funfair.
OL,15,FThe balloon club started in 1978 and is
OL,16,Fbelieved to be the only one in the UK
OL,17,Fwith membership open to the general
OL,18,Fpublic.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
