OL,3,GNEWSABalloon flight captures Goose Fair
OL,4,Afrom the air
OL,5,
OL,6,FMonday's flight was extra special for
OL,7,Fclub members Robin Macey and his son
OL,8,FAshley, as they are both former pupils
OL,9,Fof Nottingham High School.
